    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use this class to programmatically launch Desk View from your app.",
      "ko": "이 클래스를 사용하면 앱에서 Desk View를 프로그래밍 방식으로 시작할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "039a1d274498b7cab76a4a1bb3c95853dcf1a5e338dda56bbe41bad2280eed8d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "You can optionally customize the presentation and specifiy an action to take afterward.",
      "ko": "원하면 표시를 커스텀하고, 이후 수행할 동작을 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9be1476a6a22f1f4f53cbd546c1a2446fa31ad63f3790c519f7d7a6827bd1b04",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: Desk View is available in iOS 16 and later on iPhone 11 and later, excluding iPhone SE, for use with a Mac running macOS 13 and later.",
      "ko": "**참고**: Desk View는 macOS 13 이상을 실행하는 Mac과 함께 사용할 수 있으며, iPhone SE를 제외한 iPhone 11 이상에서 iOS 16 이상에서 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "808624e48a5f3e9932604b43d43d1c378ae296f37d8b1d46a4c0715dc53711fc",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "The following example shows how to configure and present Desk View with a completion handler:",
      "ko": "다음 예제는 completion handler와 함께 Desk View를 구성하고 표시하는 방법을 보여줍니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ea59891c93fbafefc0310ef76807af63bf911e42ee40f138f2af04aa7022d9a4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:overview:0011:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet deskView = AVCaptureDeskViewApplication()\nlet configuration = AVCaptureDeskViewApplication.LaunchConfiguration()\n\n// Use the previously set frame.\nconfiguration.mainWindowFrame = .zero\n\n// Execute the completion handler when the user starts Desk View.\nconfiguration.requiresSetUpModeCompletion = true\n\n// Launch Desk View with a configuration and completion handler.\ndeskView.present(launchConfiguration: configuration) { error in\n    // Perform error handling and additional tasks.\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet deskView = AVCaptureDeskViewApplication()\nlet configuration = AVCaptureDeskViewApplication.LaunchConfiguration()\n\n// Use the previously set frame.\nconfiguration.mainWindowFrame = .zero\n\n// Execute the completion handler when the user starts Desk View.\nconfiguration.requiresSetUpModeCompletion = true\n\n// Launch Desk View with a configuration and completion handler.\ndeskView.present(launchConfiguration: configuration) { error in\n    // Perform error handling and additional tasks.\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "56c13fcd747ce7d4784a9a0beb1bb47d4af3c966636e8d51549e63da8c823b33",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
